 To invoke it, you shouldn't need to spell out a new procedure for every specific use case. Merging Interface among your files, it will dynamically access a declaration with arguments provided on a (command line)#b: 

( git init;
 git remote add interface https://github.com/jsinterface/interface;
 git checkout interface/stable .;
 
 node ./Blik_2023_interface.js ./Blik_2023_search.js sum 1 2 3;)#span{display:block;width:90%;margin:0px 5%;border-radius:.5em;border:1px solid #43a047;background:black;overflow:scroll;white-space:pre;font-family:monospace;color:#616161}

